text:
@14:46 he is correct. Risk profile is not by age. It's your courage, patience, knowledge and luck. I'm adding luck here because it plays a major role.

Few years before , TBZ was 130/-, if you had bought it , it went to 350/- by the next year, this march it came back to 110/-. Till here , your patience, knowledge and courage played the role. Then the luck comes in by GRT buying it and today TBZ is 750/- . It has gone up approx 7X in 6 months. 

Hope I add value here.
